OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for city centre loop bus and
OL,4,Aone-hour ticket
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new city centre circular bus service
OL,7,Fand a one-hour ticket are being
OL,8,Fconsidered as part of a #4m upgrade
OL,9,Fprogramme.
OL,11,FBristol councillors voted on Thursday
OL,12,Fto set up a task group to spend the
OL,13,Fnext few months considering how best to
OL,14,Finvest income from the Clean Air Zone.
OL,16,FThey heard a one-hour ticket would let
OL,17,Fpassengers change on to another bus
OL,18,Fwithout having to pay twice, and a
OL,19,Fcircular service would make it easier
OL,20,Fto get around the city centre and stop
OL,21,Fother buses getting stuck coming in and
OL,22,Fout of town.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
