OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for city centre loop bus and
OL,4,Aone-hour ticket
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Ed Plowden, the chair of the
OL,7,Ftransport committee, said the aim was
OL,8,Fto make Bristol's buses work "as a
OL,9,Fnetwork rather than a collection of
OL,10,Findividual routes".
